Man: Is there any real advantage to the digital version?
Woman: Yes, it is updated all day, I can search old articles in seconds, and it only costs twenty-five riyals a month.
Man: So why keep the printed subscription at all?
Woman: Because my father prefers paper, even though it costs forty riyals a month. I keep it mainly for him.', 'What is the man most likely to do after this conversation?', '[{"id":"a","text":"Buy a subscription to both papers"},{"id":"b","text":"Stop reading the news entirely"},{"id":"c","text":"Cancel his printed paper and switch to digital"},{"id":"d","text":"Ask the woman to print articles for him"}]'::jsonb, 'c', 'The man asks about the digital advantages and why the printed one is kept, showing he is thinking of switching to digital.', 'hard', array['listening-inference']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('gx-grammar-1', 'grammar', null, null, null, null, 'I wish I ___ taller; then I could reach the top shelf.', '[{"id":"a","text":"were"},{"id":"b","text":"am"},{"id":"c","text":"will be"},{"id":"d","text":"have been"}]'::jsonb, 'a', 'A wish about an unreal present uses the past simple, and ''were'' is used for all subjects.', 'medium', array['wish','grammar-extra']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('gx-grammar-2', 'grammar', null, null, null, null, 'She wishes she ___ the invitation yesterday.', '[{"id":"a","text":"accepted"},{"id":"b","text":"had accepted"},{"id":"c","text":"would accept"},{"id":"d","text":"accepts"}]'::jsonb, 'b', 'A regret about the past needs the past perfect after ''wish''.', 'hard', array['wish','grammar-extra']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('gx-grammar-3', 'grammar', null, null, null, null, 'I wish the neighbours ___ making so much noise.', '[{"id":"a","text":"stop"},{"id":"b","text":"have stopped"},{"id":"c","text":"would stop"},{"id":"d","text":"stopping"}]'::jsonb, 'c', '''Wish'' + would + base verb expresses annoyance at a current situation and a wish for change.', 'medium', array['wish','grammar-extra']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('gx-grammar-4', 'grammar', null, null, null, null, 'My grandfather ___ get up at five every day, but now he sleeps later.', '[{"id":"a","text":"is used to"},{"id":"b","text":"was used to"},{"id":"c","text":"uses to"},{"id":"d","text":"used to"}]'::jsonb, 'd', '''Used to'' + base verb describes a past habit that has stopped (''but now...'').', 'medium', array['used-to','grammar-extra']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('gx-grammar-5', 'grammar', null, null, null, null, 'I''m not used to ___ in such cold weather.', '[{"id":"a","text":"live"},{"id":"b","text":"living"},{"id":"c","text":"lived"},{"id":"d","text":"be living"}]'::jsonb, 'b', '''Be used to'' means ''accustomed to'' and is followed by a noun or an -ing form.', 'medium', array['used-to','grammar-extra']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('gx-grammar-6', 'grammar', null, null, null, null, 'It took me a month to get used to ___ the new schedule.', '[{"id":"a","text":"follow"},{"id":"b","text":"followed"},{"id":"c","text":"following"},{"id":"d","text":"be followed"}]'::jsonb, 'c', '''Get used to'' (become accustomed to) is followed by an -ing form.', 'medium', array['used-to','grammar-extra']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('gx-grammar-7', 'grammar', null, null, null, null, 'Sara can swim, ___?', '[{"id":"a","text":"can she"},{"id":"b","text":"isn''t she"},{"id":"c","text":"doesn''t she"},{"id":"d","text":"can''t she"}]'::jsonb, 'd', 'A positive statement takes a negative tag with the same auxiliary: can''t she?', 'easy', array['question-tags','grammar-extra']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('gx-grammar-8', 'grammar', null, null, null, null, 'They never arrive on time, ___?', '[{"id":"a","text":"do they"},{"id":"b","text":"don''t they"},{"id":"c","text":"did they"},{"id":"d","text":"are they"}]'::jsonb, 'a', '''Never'' makes the statement negative, so the tag is positive: do they?', 'hard', array['question-tags','grammar-extra']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-reading-1', 'reading', null, 'passage-sm-1', null, null, 'According to the passage, what did Friedrich Miescher do in 1869?', '[{"id":"a","text":"He isolated a substance from the nuclei of white blood cells."},{"id":"b","text":"He described the double-helix structure of DNA."},{"id":"c","text":"He invented the first gene test for patients."},{"id":"d","text":"He developed a wheat plant that resists disease."}]'::jsonb, 'a', 'The passage states that in 1869 Miescher pulled an unusual substance out of the nuclei of white blood cells, an event that launched the study of genetics.', 'easy', array['reading-comprehension','detail','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-reading-2', 'reading', null, 'passage-sm-1', null, null, 'In the passage, the word ''isolated'' is closest in meaning to', '[{"id":"a","text":"combined"},{"id":"b","text":"separated"},{"id":"c","text":"invented"},{"id":"d","text":"examined"}]'::jsonb, 'b', 'To isolate means to separate something from others, which is what Miescher did when he removed the substance from the cell nuclei.', 'easy', array['reading-comprehension','vocabulary','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-reading-3', 'reading', null, 'passage-sm-1', null, null, 'What did Watson and Crick reveal about DNA in 1953?', '[{"id":"a","text":"Its official name"},{"id":"b","text":"How it is stored inside cells"},{"id":"c","text":"Its double-helix structure"},{"id":"d","text":"The four bases that form it"}]'::jsonb, 'c', 'The passage says Watson and Crick announced the double-helix structure of DNA, which showed how genetic codes copy themselves.', 'easy', array['reading-comprehension','detail','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-reading-4', 'reading', null, 'passage-sm-1', null, null, 'Which two fields have been helped by understanding DNA, according to the passage?', '[{"id":"a","text":"engineering and transport"},{"id":"b","text":"law and education"},{"id":"c","text":"trade and tourism"},{"id":"d","text":"medicine and farming"}]'::jsonb, 'd', 'The passage concludes that the discovery links medicine and farming through the same molecule, benefiting both doctors and plant breeders.', 'medium', array['reading-comprehension','main-idea','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-reading-5', 'reading', null, 'passage-sm-2', null, null, 'According to the passage, why is even a small piece of space junk dangerous?', '[{"id":"a","text":"It blocks radio communication signals."},{"id":"b","text":"It can tear through a solar panel."},{"id":"c","text":"It burns up in the atmosphere."},{"id":"d","text":"It slows down working satellites."}]'::jsonb, 'b', 'The passage warns that a single bolt moving at high speed could tear through a solar panel, so engineers change the course of satellites to avoid crashes.', 'easy', array['reading-comprehension','detail','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-reading-6', 'reading', null, 'passage-sm-2', null, null, 'In the passage, the word ''drift'' is closest in meaning to', '[{"id":"a","text":"fall quickly"},{"id":"b","text":"explode suddenly"},{"id":"c","text":"float slowly"},{"id":"d","text":"spin in circles"}]'::jsonb, 'c', 'Old satellites and rocket stages drift in orbit, meaning they float slowly through space rather than falling or exploding.', 'medium', array['reading-comprehension','vocabulary','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-reading-7', 'reading', null, 'passage-sm-2', null, null, 'How does the small extra engine help reduce space junk?', '[{"id":"a","text":"It launches satellites into higher orbits."},{"id":"b","text":"It powers the radar tracking stations."},{"id":"c","text":"It catches pieces of debris in orbit."},{"id":"d","text":"It helps the craft burn up in the upper atmosphere."}]'::jsonb, 'd', 'The engine fires downward at the end of a satellite''s life so the craft slows and burns up completely in the upper atmosphere instead of drifting for decades.', 'medium', array['reading-comprehension','detail','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-reading-8', 'reading', null, 'passage-sm-2', null, null, 'What does the Italian Space Agency say about space junk?', '[{"id":"a","text":"A quick solution is needed."},{"id":"b","text":"It is not a serious problem yet."},{"id":"c","text":"Only the largest pieces matter."},{"id":"d","text":"The problem will solve itself over time."}]'::jsonb, 'a', 'The agency warns that action must come quickly and that delay could turn low-Earth orbit into a shooting gallery, so it calls for faster international cooperation.', 'medium', array['reading-comprehension','purpose','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-reading-9', 'reading', null, 'passage-sm-3', null, null, 'According to the experts, what is the best advice during an earthquake?', '[{"id":"a","text":"Stay inside until the shaking stops."},{"id":"b","text":"Stand near a window for light."},{"id":"c","text":"Get out of the building as quickly as possible."},{"id":"d","text":"Hide behind large, heavy furniture."}]'::jsonb, 'c', 'The passage advises finding the safest route out of the building and leaving immediately if possible, moving away from walls, windows, and heavy objects.', 'easy', array['reading-comprehension','detail','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-reading-10', 'reading', null, 'passage-sm-3', null, null, 'In the passage, the word ''essential'' is closest in meaning to', '[{"id":"a","text":"optional"},{"id":"b","text":"possible"},{"id":"c","text":"dangerous"},{"id":"d","text":"necessary"}]'::jsonb, 'd', 'Experts say staying calm and acting quickly is essential, meaning it is absolutely necessary for surviving an earthquake.', 'easy', array['reading-comprehension','vocabulary','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-reading-11', 'reading', null, 'passage-sm-3', null, null, 'Why do people who live in earthquake-prone areas often feel afraid?', '[{"id":"a","text":"because the events are hard to predict"},{"id":"b","text":"because earthquakes happen every day"},{"id":"c","text":"because the ground is always shaking"},{"id":"d","text":"because their buildings are always damaged"}]'::jsonb, 'a', 'The passage says people feel afraid because the events are so hard to predict, meaning earthquakes can strike without warning.', 'medium', array['reading-comprehension','detail','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-reading-12', 'reading', null, 'passage-sm-3', null, null, 'What is the main idea of the second paragraph?', '[{"id":"a","text":"How earthquakes are formed"},{"id":"b","text":"How to protect yourself during an earthquake"},{"id":"c","text":"Why buildings collapse in strong shaking"},{"id":"d","text":"Where earthquakes happen most often"}]'::jsonb, 'b', 'The second paragraph focuses on what people should do during an earthquake, including leaving the building and moving away from dangers.', 'medium', array['reading-comprehension','main-idea','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-reading-13', 'reading', null, 'passage-sm-4', null, null, 'According to the passage, what is one benefit of bees for other creatures?', '[{"id":"a","text":"They clean the air of harmful gases."},{"id":"b","text":"They carry water to dry plants."},{"id":"c","text":"They build shelters for larger animals."},{"id":"d","text":"They produce food that other creatures need."}]'::jsonb, 'd', 'The passage states that bees make food that other creatures need and support the growth of plants that serve as food and shelter for animals.', 'easy', array['reading-comprehension','detail','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-reading-14', 'reading', null, 'passage-sm-4', null, null, 'What is the main idea of the paragraph that discusses the ecosystem?', '[{"id":"a","text":"Bees are important not only to plants but to other creatures."},{"id":"b","text":"Bees always live alone rather than in groups."},{"id":"c","text":"Sniffer bees cannot be trained to detect substances."},{"id":"d","text":"Bees are found only in warm countries."}]'::jsonb, 'a', 'The paragraph explains the central role bees play in the ecosystem, helping plants grow so that plants can provide food and shelter for other creatures.', 'medium', array['reading-comprehension','main-idea','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-reading-15', 'reading', null, 'passage-sm-4', null, null, 'In the passage, the pronoun ''They'' in ''They make food that other creatures need'' refers to', '[{"id":"a","text":"scientists"},{"id":"b","text":"bees"},{"id":"c","text":"plants"},{"id":"d","text":"colonies"}]'::jsonb, 'b', 'The pronoun ''They'' continues the subject from the previous sentence, which is about bees and the role they play in the ecosystem.', 'medium', array['reading-comprehension','pronoun-reference','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-reading-16', 'reading', null, 'passage-sm-4', null, null, 'In the passage, the word ''enthusiastic'' is closest in meaning to', '[{"id":"a","text":"tired and bored"},{"id":"b","text":"angry and upset"},{"id":"c","text":"eager and positive"},{"id":"d","text":"careful and slow"}]'::jsonb, 'c', 'The rewarded bees reacted more hopefully and enthusiastically to new challenges, so the word describes an eager, positive attitude.', 'hard', array['reading-comprehension','vocabulary','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-reading-17', 'reading', null, 'passage-sm-5', null, null, 'According to the passage, where was the first real paper made?', '[{"id":"a","text":"China"},{"id":"b","text":"Egypt"},{"id":"c","text":"France"},{"id":"d","text":"Spain"}]'::jsonb, 'a', 'The passage says true paper appeared in China around the year 105 CE, made by a man named Ts''ai Lun.', 'easy', array['reading-comprehension','detail','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-reading-18', 'reading', null, 'passage-sm-5', null, null, 'What did the ancient Egyptians do with the stems of the papyrus plant?', '[{"id":"a","text":"They boiled them to make ink for writing."},{"id":"b","text":"They flattened them and pressed them together."},{"id":"c","text":"They planted them in long rows beside the river."},{"id":"d","text":"They burned them for fuel during the winter."}]'::jsonb, 'b', 'The passage describes how the Egyptians flattened the fibrous stems, laid them crosswise, and pressed them together so they stuck and could be written on.', 'easy', array['reading-comprehension','detail','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-reading-19', 'reading', null, 'passage-sm-5', null, null, 'In the passage, the word ''beating'' is closest in meaning to', '[{"id":"a","text":"folding carefully"},{"id":"b","text":"drying slowly"},{"id":"c","text":"hitting repeatedly"},{"id":"d","text":"painting gently"}]'::jsonb, 'c', 'Ts''ai Lun separated the fibres by beating the bark in water, which means striking it repeatedly rather than folding or drying it.', 'medium', array['reading-comprehension','vocabulary','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-reading-20', 'reading', null, 'passage-sm-5', null, null, 'According to the passage, how did the art of paper-making reach Europe?', '[{"id":"a","text":"Chinese traders sold it directly to European kings."},{"id":"b","text":"European scientists invented it on their own."},{"id":"c","text":"The ancient Egyptians brought it by sea."},{"id":"d","text":"Arab merchants learned the secret and took it to Spain."}]'::jsonb, 'd', 'Chinese traders carried the knowledge to Samarkand, where Arab merchants learned it and later brought it to Spain, from which it spread across Europe.', 'medium', array['reading-comprehension','detail','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-reading-21', 'reading', null, 'passage-sm-6', null, null, 'According to the passage, which city has the highest rainfall in Saudi Arabia?', '[{"id":"a","text":"Qassim"},{"id":"b","text":"Abha"},{"id":"c","text":"Makkah"},{"id":"d","text":"Madinah"}]'::jsonb, 'b', 'The passage says Abha receives more rain than any other city in the country and is known as the wettest place in the kingdom.', 'easy', array['reading-comprehension','detail','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-reading-22', 'reading', null, 'passage-sm-6', null, null, 'Which parts of Saudi Arabia experience the highest number of dust storms?', '[{"id":"a","text":"the western region near the Red Sea coast"},{"id":"b","text":"the southern highlands near the border"},{"id":"c","text":"the eastern and central parts"},{"id":"d","text":"the coastal islands in the Arabian Gulf"}]'::jsonb, 'c', 'The passage states that the eastern and central parts of Saudi Arabia suffer the highest number of dust storms each year, as seen in Qassim.', 'medium', array['reading-comprehension','detail','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-reading-23', 'reading', null, 'passage-sm-6', null, null, 'Which city does the passage describe as the hottest in Saudi Arabia?', '[{"id":"a","text":"Abha"},{"id":"b","text":"Qassim"},{"id":"c","text":"Madinah"},{"id":"d","text":"Makkah"}]'::jsonb, 'd', 'Makkah is called the hottest city in Saudi Arabia, with summer temperatures that sometimes pass forty-eight degrees Celsius.', 'easy', array['reading-comprehension','detail','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-reading-24', 'reading', null, 'passage-sm-6', null, null, 'What is the passage mainly about?', '[{"id":"a","text":"the climatic zones and weather diversity of the kingdom"},{"id":"b","text":"the religious history of the kingdom and its holy cities"},{"id":"c","text":"the population growth of the largest Saudi cities"},{"id":"d","text":"the oil resources of the kingdom and their uses"}]'::jsonb, 'a', 'The passage explains that the kingdom has three climatic zones and then describes how weather differs across Abha, Qassim, Makkah, and Madinah.', 'medium', array['reading-comprehension','main-idea','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-reading-25', 'reading', null, 'passage-sm-7', null, null, 'According to the passage, who first suggested building a bridge between Bahrain and Saudi Arabia?', '[{"id":"a","text":"King Fahd"},{"id":"b","text":"King Faisal"},{"id":"c","text":"King Saud"},{"id":"d","text":"Essa bin Salman Al Khalifa"}]'::jsonb, 'c', 'The passage says the idea was first suggested by King Saud in 1954, long before construction actually began.', 'easy', array['reading-comprehension','detail','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-reading-26', 'reading', null, 'passage-sm-7', null, null, 'When did the two countries officially agree to construct the causeway?', '[{"id":"a","text":"1954"},{"id":"b","text":"1968"},{"id":"c","text":"2010"},{"id":"d","text":"1965"}]'::jsonb, 'd', 'In 1965, Sheikh Khalifa bin Salman Al Khalifa and King Faisal agreed to build the causeway; the joint committee was formed later in 1968.', 'medium', array['reading-comprehension','detail','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-reading-27', 'reading', null, 'passage-sm-7', null, null, 'How long is the Bahraini side of the bridge?', '[{"id":"a","text":"4,296 metres"},{"id":"b","text":"1,954 metres"},{"id":"c","text":"6,000 metres"},{"id":"d","text":"19,000 metres"}]'::jsonb, 'a', 'The passage states that the Bahraini side of the bridge measures about 4,296 metres.', 'medium', array['reading-comprehension','detail','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-reading-28', 'reading', null, 'passage-sm-7', null, null, 'What is the best title for this passage?', '[{"id":"a","text":"How Artificial Islands Are Built"},{"id":"b","text":"A Bridge between Two Nations"},{"id":"c","text":"The History of Bahrain"},{"id":"d","text":"The World Bank in the Gulf"}]'::jsonb, 'b', 'The passage covers the planning, naming, and importance of the causeway, which it describes as a bridge between two nations.', 'medium', array['reading-comprehension','main-idea','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-reading-29', 'reading', null, 'passage-sm-8', null, null, 'According to the passage, how do ants find food?', '[{"id":"a","text":"by seeing it"},{"id":"b","text":"by hearing it"},{"id":"c","text":"by touching the ground"},{"id":"d","text":"by smell"}]'::jsonb, 'd', 'The passage says ants find food mainly through their sense of smell, using chemical signals, sounds, and touch to communicate.', 'easy', array['reading-comprehension','detail','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-reading-30', 'reading', null, 'passage-sm-8', null, null, 'What is the special job of meat ants?', '[{"id":"a","text":"They protect the nest."},{"id":"b","text":"They lay eggs for the colony."},{"id":"c","text":"They collect honey from flowers."},{"id":"d","text":"They build bridges between trees."}]'::jsonb, 'a', 'The passage says a type of ant called meat ants has the special job of protecting the nest.', 'easy', array['reading-comprehension','detail','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-reading-31', 'reading', null, 'passage-sm-8', null, null, 'In the passage, the pronoun ''They'' in ''They find food mainly through their sense of smell'' refers to', '[{"id":"a","text":"flies"},{"id":"b","text":"ants"},{"id":"c","text":"pheromones"},{"id":"d","text":"colonies"}]'::jsonb, 'b', 'The pronoun ''They'' refers back to the ants, the subject of the previous sentences about communication and finding food.', 'medium', array['reading-comprehension','pronoun-reference','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-reading-32', 'reading', null, 'passage-sm-8', null, null, 'What is the main topic of the passage?', '[{"id":"a","text":"the dangers that ants cause to humans"},{"id":"b","text":"how to remove ants from homes"},{"id":"c","text":"how ants are organized and live together"},{"id":"d","text":"the colors of ants only"}]'::jsonb, 'c', 'The passage describes ant species, colonies, communication, feeding, and the roles of the queen and workers, all about how ants are organized.', 'medium', array['reading-comprehension','main-idea','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-reading-33', 'reading', null, 'passage-sm-9', null, null, 'According to the passage, which animals sleep in groups to keep warm?', '[{"id":"a","text":"lions, monkeys, and penguins"},{"id":"b","text":"snakes and flamingos on cold nights"},{"id":"c","text":"horses and cows in the open fields"},{"id":"d","text":"bats and owls in the caves where they live"}]'::jsonb, 'a', 'The passage lists lions, monkeys, and penguins as animals that sleep in groups for warmth.', 'easy', array['reading-comprehension','detail','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-reading-34', 'reading', null, 'passage-sm-9', null, null, 'Which of the following animals sleep standing, according to the passage?', '[{"id":"a","text":"snakes that rest on the warm ground"},{"id":"b","text":"large elephants and horses"},{"id":"c","text":"young elephants that lie down to rest"},{"id":"d","text":"penguins that stand in huge groups"}]'::jsonb, 'b', 'Large elephants and horses both sleep standing; young elephants, by contrast, lie down inside the group.', 'medium', array['reading-comprehension','detail','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-reading-35', 'reading', null, 'passage-sm-9', null, null, 'Which statement about snakes is correct according to the passage?', '[{"id":"a","text":"They sleep all day long."},{"id":"b","text":"They close their eyes while sleeping."},{"id":"c","text":"They do not really sleep."},{"id":"d","text":"They sleep standing on one leg."}]'::jsonb, 'c', 'The passage says snakes cannot close their eyes or even blink, so they do not really sleep in the way other animals do.', 'medium', array['reading-comprehension','detail','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-reading-36', 'reading', null, 'passage-sm-9', null, null, 'What is the best title for this passage?', '[{"id":"a","text":"Why Animals Need Food"},{"id":"b","text":"Animals That Live in Groups"},{"id":"c","text":"The Danger of Nocturnal Animals"},{"id":"d","text":"How Animals Sleep"}]'::jsonb, 'd', 'The passage describes the different ways, places, and times animals sleep, so ''How Animals Sleep'' best summarizes it.', 'easy', array['reading-comprehension','main-idea','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-reading-37', 'reading', null, 'passage-sm-10', null, null, 'According to the passage, at what age did Ibn Sina become a skilled physician?', '[{"id":"a","text":"thirteen"},{"id":"b","text":"sixteen"},{"id":"c","text":"twenty-five"},{"id":"d","text":"fifty-six"}]'::jsonb, 'b', 'Ibn Sina began studying medicine at thirteen and became a skilled physician at sixteen, working long hours with his patients.', 'easy', array['reading-comprehension','detail','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-reading-38', 'reading', null, 'passage-sm-10', null, null, 'What did the Sultan of Bukhara give Ibn Sina as a reward?', '[{"id":"a","text":"a village to govern and its farmland"},{"id":"b","text":"five books on law from his own collection"},{"id":"c","text":"permission to use the royal library"},{"id":"d","text":"a new hospital to manage in the capital"}]'::jsonb, 'c', 'After the Sultan recovered, he rewarded Ibn Sina by allowing him to use the royal library, where he could study rare manuscripts.', 'medium', array['reading-comprehension','detail','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-reading-39', 'reading', null, 'passage-sm-10', null, null, 'In the passage, the word ''skilled'' is closest in meaning to', '[{"id":"a","text":"famous"},{"id":"b","text":"careful"},{"id":"c","text":"lucky"},{"id":"d","text":"expert"}]'::jsonb, 'd', 'A skilled physician is one who has expert ability in medicine, which matches Ibn Sina''s reputation described in the passage.', 'easy', array['reading-comprehension','vocabulary','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-reading-40', 'reading', null, 'passage-sm-10', null, null, 'What was the name of Ibn Sina''s most important medical work?', '[{"id":"a","text":"the Qanun fit Tibb"},{"id":"b","text":"Al-Mantiq"},{"id":"c","text":"Remarks and Admonitions"},{"id":"d","text":"The Royal Library"}]'::jsonb, 'a', 'His most important work was the Qanun fit Tibb, an encyclopedia of medicine in five volumes completed in 1025.', 'hard', array['reading-comprehension','detail','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-grammar-1', 'grammar', null, null, null, null, 'This new phone is ___ than my old one.', '[{"id":"a","text":"cheaper"},{"id":"b","text":"cheap"},{"id":"c","text":"cheapest"},{"id":"d","text":"more cheap"}]'::jsonb, 'a', 'Short adjectives form the comparative with "-er" and "than": cheaper.', 'easy', array['comparatives','comparatives-superlatives','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-grammar-2', 'grammar', null, null, null, null, 'This is ___ city in the whole country.', '[{"id":"a","text":"most busy"},{"id":"b","text":"busiest"},{"id":"c","text":"busier"},{"id":"d","text":"more busy"}]'::jsonb, 'b', '"The + -est" marks the superlative: the busiest city. "-er" would compare only two things.', 'easy', array['superlatives','comparatives-superlatives','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-grammar-3', 'grammar', null, null, null, null, 'Rana speaks English almost ___ a native speaker.', '[{"id":"a","text":"more fluently than"},{"id":"b","text":"as fluent as"},{"id":"c","text":"as fluently as"},{"id":"d","text":"the most fluent"}]'::jsonb, 'c', '"As + adverb + as" expresses equality. Since it modifies "speaks" (a verb), the adverb "fluently" is needed.', 'medium', array['comparatives','adverbs','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-grammar-4', 'grammar', null, null, null, null, 'There isn''t ___ sugar left in the jar.', '[{"id":"a","text":"some"},{"id":"b","text":"many"},{"id":"c","text":"a"},{"id":"d","text":"any"}]'::jsonb, 'd', 'In negatives we use "any" with uncountable nouns like "sugar".', 'easy', array['countable-uncountable','quantifiers','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-grammar-5', 'grammar', null, null, null, null, 'How ___ information does the website ask for?', '[{"id":"a","text":"many"},{"id":"b","text":"much"},{"id":"c","text":"a few"},{"id":"d","text":"several"}]'::jsonb, 'b', '"Information" is uncountable, so we use "much" (or "how much"), not "many".', 'easy', array['countable-uncountable','quantifiers','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-grammar-6', 'grammar', null, null, null, null, 'The meeting will start ___ ten o''clock ___ Monday.', '[{"id":"a","text":"in / at"},{"id":"b","text":"on / in"},{"id":"c","text":"at / on"},{"id":"d","text":"at / in"}]'::jsonb, 'c', '"At" is used for clock times, and "on" is used for days of the week.', 'easy', array['prepositions','prepositions-time','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-grammar-7', 'grammar', null, null, null, null, 'The supermarket is ___ the bank and the mosque.', '[{"id":"a","text":"among"},{"id":"b","text":"across"},{"id":"c","text":"onto"},{"id":"d","text":"between"}]'::jsonb, 'd', '"Between" is used for a position in the middle of two things; "among" requires three or more.', 'medium', array['prepositions','prepositions-place','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-grammar-8', 'grammar', null, null, null, null, 'When I was six, I ___ ride a bike without help.', '[{"id":"a","text":"could"},{"id":"b","text":"can"},{"id":"c","text":"will"},{"id":"d","text":"would"}]'::jsonb, 'a', '"Could" is the past form of "can" and expresses past ability.', 'medium', array['modals','past-ability','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-grammar-9', 'grammar', null, null, null, null, 'You ___ bring an umbrella; the sky is completely clear.', '[{"id":"a","text":"mustn''t"},{"id":"b","text":"couldn''t"},{"id":"c","text":"don''t have to"},{"id":"d","text":"won''t"}]'::jsonb, 'c', '"Don''t have to" means there is no obligation. "Mustn''t" would mean it is forbidden.', 'medium', array['modals','obligation','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-grammar-10', 'grammar', null, null, null, null, 'You look tired. You ___ get some rest before the exam.', '[{"id":"a","text":"would"},{"id":"b","text":"mustn''t"},{"id":"c","text":"shouldn''t"},{"id":"d","text":"should"}]'::jsonb, 'd', '"Should" gives advice or a recommendation.', 'medium', array['modals','advice','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-grammar-11', 'grammar', null, null, null, null, 'Omar ___ to school by bus every day.', '[{"id":"a","text":"goes"},{"id":"b","text":"go"},{"id":"c","text":"going"},{"id":"d","text":"gone"}]'::jsonb, 'a', 'Habits in the present simple take "-s/es" with a third-person singular subject.', 'easy', array['tenses','present-simple','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-grammar-12', 'grammar', null, null, null, null, 'Look outside! It ___ heavily right now.', '[{"id":"a","text":"rains"},{"id":"b","text":"is raining"},{"id":"c","text":"rained"},{"id":"d","text":"has rained"}]'::jsonb, 'b', '"Right now" signals an action in progress, so the present continuous "is raining" is used.', 'easy', array['tenses','present-continuous','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-grammar-13', 'grammar', null, null, null, null, 'We have been neighbors ___ ten years.', '[{"id":"a","text":"since"},{"id":"b","text":"during"},{"id":"c","text":"ago"},{"id":"d","text":"for"}]'::jsonb, 'd', '"For" is used with a period of time (ten years); "since" is used with a starting point.', 'medium', array['tenses','present-perfect','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-grammar-14', 'grammar', null, null, null, null, 'Yesterday, the children ___ a kite in the park.', '[{"id":"a","text":"flew"},{"id":"b","text":"fly"},{"id":"c","text":"flies"},{"id":"d","text":"flown"}]'::jsonb, 'a', '"Yesterday" requires the past simple; "flew" is the past form of "fly".', 'easy', array['tenses','past-simple','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-grammar-15', 'grammar', null, null, null, null, 'While I ___ dinner, my phone rang.', '[{"id":"a","text":"cooked"},{"id":"b","text":"was cooking"},{"id":"c","text":"have cooked"},{"id":"d","text":"cook"}]'::jsonb, 'b', 'A longer past action interrupted by another uses "was/were + verb-ing" (past continuous) with "while".', 'medium', array['tenses','past-continuous','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-grammar-16', 'grammar', null, null, null, null, 'By the time the guests arrived, we ___ the food.', '[{"id":"a","text":"cooked"},{"id":"b","text":"have cooked"},{"id":"c","text":"had cooked"},{"id":"d","text":"were cooking"}]'::jsonb, 'c', 'An action completed before another past action needs the past perfect: "had + past participle".', 'hard', array['tenses','past-perfect','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-grammar-17', 'grammar', null, null, null, null, 'I can''t attend tomorrow; I ___ my cousin at the airport.', '[{"id":"a","text":"am going to meet"},{"id":"b","text":"will meet"},{"id":"c","text":"have met"},{"id":"d","text":"met"}]'::jsonb, 'a', '"Be going to" expresses a plan or intention made before speaking, matching the arranged plan here.', 'medium', array['tenses','future','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-grammar-18', 'grammar', null, null, null, null, 'My father enjoys ___ chess with his friends.', '[{"id":"a","text":"to play"},{"id":"b","text":"playing"},{"id":"c","text":"play"},{"id":"d","text":"plays"}]'::jsonb, 'b', '"Enjoy" is followed by a gerund (verb + -ing), never by "to + verb".', 'easy', array['gerunds-infinitives','gerund','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-grammar-19', 'grammar', null, null, null, null, 'The manager asked us ___ the reports before noon.', '[{"id":"a","text":"finishing"},{"id":"b","text":"finish"},{"id":"c","text":"to finish"},{"id":"d","text":"finished"}]'::jsonb, 'c', '"Ask/tell/want + object" is followed by the infinitive "to + verb".', 'medium', array['gerunds-infinitives','infinitive','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-grammar-20', 'grammar', null, null, null, null, 'These houses ___ almost one hundred years ago.', '[{"id":"a","text":"built"},{"id":"b","text":"are built"},{"id":"c","text":"have built"},{"id":"d","text":"were built"}]'::jsonb, 'd', 'The subject receives the action, so the past passive "was/were + past participle" is needed.', 'hard', array['passive-voice','tenses','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-grammar-21', 'grammar', null, null, null, null, 'The teacher ___ car was stolen reported it to the police.', '[{"id":"a","text":"who"},{"id":"b","text":"whose"},{"id":"c","text":"which"},{"id":"d","text":"whom"}]'::jsonb, 'b', '"Whose" shows possession and connects "the teacher" to "car".', 'hard', array['pronouns','relative-pronouns','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-grammar-22', 'grammar', null, null, null, null, 'He taught ___ to cook when he lived alone.', '[{"id":"a","text":"him"},{"id":"b","text":"hisself"},{"id":"c","text":"himself"},{"id":"d","text":"he"}]'::jsonb, 'c', 'A reflexive pronoun ("himself") refers back to the subject when it performs the action on itself.', 'medium', array['pronouns','reflexive-pronouns','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-grammar-23', 'grammar', null, null, null, null, 'If the bus is late, we ___ the beginning of the show.', '[{"id":"a","text":"miss"},{"id":"b","text":"missed"},{"id":"c","text":"would miss"},{"id":"d","text":"will miss"}]'::jsonb, 'd', 'First conditional: "if + present simple" is followed by "will + base verb".', 'medium', array['conditionals','first-conditional','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-grammar-24', 'grammar', null, null, null, null, 'I wish I ___ my keys before leaving the house.', '[{"id":"a","text":"had checked"},{"id":"b","text":"checked"},{"id":"c","text":"check"},{"id":"d","text":"have checked"}]'::jsonb, 'a', 'A wish about the past expresses regret and uses "had + past participle".', 'hard', array['conditionals','wish','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-grammar-25', 'grammar', null, null, null, null, 'She has already finished her project, ___?', '[{"id":"a","text":"has she"},{"id":"b","text":"doesn''t she"},{"id":"c","text":"hasn''t she"},{"id":"d","text":"didn''t she"}]'::jsonb, 'c', 'A positive statement takes a negative tag with the same auxiliary: "hasn''t she".', 'medium', array['question-tags','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-grammar-26', 'grammar', null, null, null, null, 'He said that he ___ his brother the day before.', '[{"id":"a","text":"meets"},{"id":"b","text":"met"},{"id":"c","text":"has met"},{"id":"d","text":"had met"}]'::jsonb, 'd', 'In reported speech, past simple often shifts to past perfect, and "yesterday" becomes "the day before".', 'hard', array['reported-speech','tenses','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-grammar-27', 'grammar', null, null, null, null, 'Noura hopes to become ___ engineer after graduation.', '[{"id":"a","text":"an"},{"id":"b","text":"a"},{"id":"c","text":"the"},{"id":"d","text":"no article"}]'::jsonb, 'a', 'Use "an" before a singular countable noun that begins with a vowel sound: "an engineer".', 'easy', array['articles','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-grammar-28', 'grammar', null, null, null, null, 'Never ___ such a beautiful sunset before.', '[{"id":"a","text":"I have seen"},{"id":"b","text":"have I seen"},{"id":"c","text":"I saw"},{"id":"d","text":"I had seen"}]'::jsonb, 'b', 'When "never" (or "hardly", "seldom") begins a sentence, the auxiliary comes before the subject: "Never have I seen".', 'hard', array['inversion','adverbs','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-grammar-29', 'grammar', null, null, null, null, 'Either of the two plans ___ acceptable to the committee.', '[{"id":"a","text":"are"},{"id":"b","text":"were"},{"id":"c","text":"have been"},{"id":"d","text":"is"}]'::jsonb, 'd', '"Either of" is singular, so the singular verb "is" agrees with the subject.', 'medium', array['subject-verb-agreement','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-grammar-30', 'grammar', null, null, null, null, 'Neither the manager nor the workers ___ satisfied with the decision.', '[{"id":"a","text":"were"},{"id":"b","text":"was"},{"id":"c","text":"is"},{"id":"d","text":"has been"}]'::jsonb, 'a', 'With "neither...nor", the verb agrees with the nearer subject ("workers"), so the plural "were" is correct.', 'hard', array['correlative-conjunctions','subject-verb-agreement','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-listening-1', 'listening', null, null, null, 'Teacher: That''s all for today, everyone. Please study well for your final exams. Does anyone have any questions before we finish?
Student: Yes, Mrs. Smith. When exactly is our final exam?
Teacher: It''s on Monday, the 26th of December.
Student: Will the exam cover all six units we have studied?
Teacher: No, not all of them. Only the last two units will be on the test.
Student: Only two units? That''s great news. Thank you, teacher.
Teacher: You''re welcome. Study hard and good luck to all of you.', 'When will the students have their final exam?', '[{"id":"a","text":"Next Monday"},{"id":"b","text":"Next Friday"},{"id":"c","text":"In two weeks"},{"id":"d","text":"In a month"}]'::jsonb, 'a', 'The teacher tells the class that the final exam is on Monday, the 26th of December, which is the coming Monday.', 'easy', array['listening-comprehension','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
