Professor: It certainly was. Yet despite these challenges, she became one of the most beloved writers in English literature. She passed away in 1817, but her books are still read and loved today.', 'In which year did Jane Austen die?', '[{"id":"a","text":"1812"},{"id":"b","text":"1827"},{"id":"c","text":"1871"},{"id":"d","text":"1817"}]'::jsonb, 'd', 'The professor states that Jane Austen passed away in 1817, yet her works are still read and admired today.', 'medium', array['listening-comprehension','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-writing-1', 'writingAnalysis', null, null, null, null, 'Which of the following is correctly punctuated?', '[{"id":"a","text":"\"We bought apples, oranges, bananas and dates at the market.\""},{"id":"b","text":"\"We bought apples oranges bananas and dates at the market.\""},{"id":"c","text":"\"We bought apples, oranges bananas, and dates at the market.\""},{"id":"d","text":"\"We bought apples, oranges, bananas, and dates, at the market.\""}]'::jsonb, 'a', 'Commas separate items in a list, and the last two items are joined with "and" (the comma before "and" is optional).', 'medium', array['punctuation','commas-in-series','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-writing-2', 'writingAnalysis', null, null, null, null, 'Which of the following is correctly punctuated?', '[{"id":"a","text":"\"Dr. Fahad our professor, explains the lesson clearly.\""},{"id":"b","text":"\"Dr. Fahad, our professor, explains the lesson clearly.\""},{"id":"c","text":"\"Dr. Fahad, our professor explains the lesson clearly.\""},{"id":"d","text":"\"Dr. Fahad our professor explains, the lesson clearly.\""}]'::jsonb, 'b', 'An appositive (extra information about a person) is set off by two commas: "Dr. Fahad, our professor, explains...".', 'medium', array['punctuation','appositives','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-writing-3', 'writingAnalysis', null, null, null, null, 'Which of the following sentences is correctly capitalized?', '[{"id":"a","text":"\"We visited the red sea and met Mr. Khalid.\""},{"id":"b","text":"\"We visited the Red sea and met mr. Khalid.\""},{"id":"c","text":"\"We visited the Red Sea and met Mr. Khalid.\""},{"id":"d","text":"\"We visited the red Sea and met Mr. khalid.\""}]'::jsonb, 'c', 'Proper nouns (the Red Sea) and titles (Mr.) are capitalized.', 'medium', array['capitalization','proper-nouns','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-writing-4', 'writingAnalysis', null, null, null, null, 'Which of the following sentences is correctly capitalized?', '[{"id":"a","text":"\"This Winter, my family will travel to Jeddah.\""},{"id":"b","text":"\"This Winter, my Family will travel to Jeddah.\""},{"id":"c","text":"\"This winter, my family will travel to jeddah.\""},{"id":"d","text":"\"This winter, my family will travel to Jeddah.\""}]'::jsonb, 'd', 'Seasons (winter, summer) are not capitalized, while proper nouns like city names (Jeddah) are.', 'easy', array['capitalization','seasons','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-writing-5', 'writingAnalysis', null, null, null, null, 'Choose the correct word order:', '[{"id":"a","text":"\"Salem every morning drinks tea.\""},{"id":"b","text":"\"Salem drinks tea every morning.\""},{"id":"c","text":"\"Every morning Salem tea drinks.\""},{"id":"d","text":"\"Tea drinks Salem every morning.\""}]'::jsonb, 'b', 'Standard word order is subject + verb + object, with adverbs of frequency before the main verb: "Salem drinks tea every morning."', 'medium', array['word-order','sentence-structure','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-writing-6', 'writingAnalysis', null, null, null, null, 'Rearrange the sentences below to form a logical paragraph about Ahmad''s morning:', '[{"id":"a","text":"\"(3-1-4-2)\""},{"id":"b","text":"\"(4-1-3-2)\""},{"id":"c","text":"\"(3-4-1-2)\""},{"id":"d","text":"\"(1-3-4-2)\""}]'::jsonb, 'c', 'Start with the topic sentence (3), then sequence the actions in time order: wake up (4), have breakfast (1), leave home (2).', 'hard', array['word-order','sequencing','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-writing-7', 'writingAnalysis', null, null, null, null, 'Which of the following sentences is correctly capitalized?', '[{"id":"a","text":"\"My mother Hajar works at King Fahd hospital.\""},{"id":"b","text":"\"My Mother Hajar works at King Fahd Hospital.\""},{"id":"c","text":"\"My mother hajar works at King Fahd Hospital.\""},{"id":"d","text":"\"My mother Hajar works at King Fahd Hospital.\""}]'::jsonb, 'd', 'Names of people (Hajar) and named institutions (King Fahd Hospital) are capitalized; "mother" is not capitalized here.', 'medium', array['capitalization','proper-nouns','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-writing-8', 'writingAnalysis', null, null, null, null, 'Identify the error: "Each of the drivers were fined for speeding."', '[{"id":"a","text":"\"were\" should be \"was\""},{"id":"b","text":"\"Each\" should be \"Every\""},{"id":"c","text":"\"drivers\" should be \"driver\""},{"id":"d","text":"\"fined\" should be \"fining\""}]'::jsonb, 'a', '"Each of" is singular, so the verb must be "was", not "were".', 'medium', array['error-identification','subject-verb-agreement','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-writing-9', 'writingAnalysis', null, null, null, null, 'Which of the following is correctly punctuated?', '[{"id":"a","text":"\"where is the nearest hospital?\""},{"id":"b","text":"\"Where is the nearest hospital.\""},{"id":"c","text":"\"Where is the nearest hospital?\""},{"id":"d","text":"\"Where is, the nearest hospital?\""}]'::jsonb, 'c', 'A question ends with a question mark and starts with a capital letter.', 'easy', array['punctuation','question-marks','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm-writing-10', 'writingAnalysis', null, null, null, null, 'Identify the error: "Although it was raining, but we still went to the beach."', '[{"id":"a","text":"\"Although\" should be \"Despite\""},{"id":"b","text":"\"still\" should be \"yet\""},{"id":"c","text":"\"went\" should be \"go\""},{"id":"d","text":"\"but\" should be removed"}]'::jsonb, 'd', '"Although" and "but" cannot both connect the same clause; remove "but" or "although".', 'hard', array['error-identification','conjunctions','step-mock']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm2-reading-1', 'reading', null, 'passage-sm2-1', null, null, 'In the passage, the word ''enormous'' is closest in meaning to', '[{"id":"a","text":"huge"},{"id":"b","text":"fragile"},{"id":"c","text":"colourful"},{"id":"d","text":"ancient"}]'::jsonb, 'a', 'Layers piling up over thousands of years form very large structures, so ''enormous'' means huge.', 'easy', array['reading-comprehension','vocabulary','step-mock-2']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm2-reading-2', 'reading', null, 'passage-sm2-1', null, null, 'Why do reefs grow best in warm, clear, shallow water?', '[{"id":"a","text":"Fish need warm water to lay their eggs on the reef."},{"id":"b","text":"The algae inside the polyps need sunlight to make food."},{"id":"c","text":"Limestone dissolves in cold water and weakens the coral."},{"id":"d","text":"Polyps cannot survive anywhere below the surface of the sea."}]'::jsonb, 'b', 'The passage says reefs grow best there ''because the algae living inside the polyps need sunlight to make food''.', 'easy', array['reading-comprehension','detail','step-mock-2']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm2-reading-3', 'reading', null, 'passage-sm2-1', null, null, 'In the passage, ''This process'' refers to', '[{"id":"a","text":"the building of limestone skeletons"},{"id":"b","text":"the growth of new polyps"},{"id":"c","text":"corals pushing out their algae"},{"id":"d","text":"the warming of the sea"}]'::jsonb, 'c', 'The sentence before explains that corals push out their algae and turn white; that process is called bleaching.', 'medium', array['reading-comprehension','pronoun-reference','step-mock-2']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm2-reading-4', 'reading', null, 'passage-sm2-1', null, null, 'Which statement best expresses the main idea of the passage?', '[{"id":"a","text":"The Great Barrier Reef is the largest structure ever built on Earth."},{"id":"b","text":"Algae are more important to the sea than the corals themselves."},{"id":"c","text":"Reefs now cover most of the ocean floor in warm tropical regions."},{"id":"d","text":"Coral reefs are built by tiny animals and are threatened by warmer seas."}]'::jsonb, 'd', 'The passage explains how reefs are built and then how rising temperatures threaten them; the other options are details or false.', 'medium', array['reading-comprehension','main-idea','step-mock-2']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm2-reading-5', 'reading', null, 'passage-sm2-2', null, null, 'In the passage, the word ''flourish'' is closest in meaning to', '[{"id":"a","text":"decline"},{"id":"b","text":"thrive"},{"id":"c","text":"begin slowly"},{"id":"d","text":"disappear"}]'::jsonb, 'b', 'The routes grew busy and prosperous after 130 BCE, so ''flourish'' means thrive.', 'easy', array['reading-comprehension','vocabulary','step-mock-2']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm2-reading-6', 'reading', null, 'passage-sm2-2', null, null, 'According to the passage, why did goods pass from trader to trader?', '[{"id":"a","text":"Rulers forbade foreign trade."},{"id":"b","text":"Silk was too heavy to carry far."},{"id":"c","text":"Merchants rarely travelled the whole route."},{"id":"d","text":"Roads were closed in winter."}]'::jsonb, 'c', 'The passage states that merchants rarely travelled the entire distance, so goods changed hands.', 'easy', array['reading-comprehension','detail','step-mock-2']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm2-reading-7', 'reading', null, 'passage-sm2-2', null, null, 'In the passage, ''each one'' in ''each one added a profit'' refers to', '[{"id":"a","text":"each emperor"},{"id":"b","text":"each road"},{"id":"c","text":"each city"},{"id":"d","text":"each trader"}]'::jsonb, 'd', 'Goods passed ''from trader to trader'', and each trader added a profit.', 'medium', array['reading-comprehension','pronoun-reference','step-mock-2']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm2-reading-8', 'reading', null, 'passage-sm2-2', null, null, 'Which statement would the historians mentioned in the passage most likely agree with?', '[{"id":"a","text":"The exchange of ideas mattered more than the goods."},{"id":"b","text":"Silk was the only valuable cargo."},{"id":"c","text":"Sea routes were less useful than roads."},{"id":"d","text":"Samarkand was the largest city in the world."}]'::jsonb, 'a', 'The last sentence says historians agree that the exchange of knowledge did more to shape the world than any cargo of silk.', 'hard', array['reading-comprehension','inference','step-mock-2']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm2-reading-9', 'reading', null, 'passage-sm2-3', null, null, 'In the passage, the word ''stable'' is closest in meaning to', '[{"id":"a","text":"quick"},{"id":"b","text":"expensive"},{"id":"c","text":"steady"},{"id":"d","text":"noisy"}]'::jsonb, 'c', 'A rider sitting low on equal-sized wheels is steady and unlikely to fall, which is what ''stable'' means.', 'easy', array['reading-comprehension','vocabulary','step-mock-2']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm2-reading-10', 'reading', null, 'passage-sm2-3', null, null, 'Why was the high-wheeler dangerous?', '[{"id":"a","text":"Its chain often broke, which made riders lose control."},{"id":"b","text":"It had no way of stopping once it started moving."},{"id":"c","text":"Its wheels were made of wood and broke on rough roads."},{"id":"d","text":"Riders sat high up and could fall forward over a stone."}]'::jsonb, 'd', 'The passage says riders sat high above the ground and fell forward if they hit a stone.', 'medium', array['reading-comprehension','detail','step-mock-2']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm2-reading-11', 'reading', null, 'passage-sm2-3', null, null, 'In the passage, ''It'' in ''It had two wheels of equal size'' refers to', '[{"id":"a","text":"the safety bicycle"},{"id":"b","text":"the chain"},{"id":"c","text":"the high-wheeler"},{"id":"d","text":"the boneshaker"}]'::jsonb, 'a', 'The previous sentence introduces the ''safety bicycle'' of the 1880s; the next sentence describes it.', 'medium', array['reading-comprehension','pronoun-reference','step-mock-2']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm2-reading-12', 'reading', null, 'passage-sm2-3', null, null, 'What is the best title for the passage?', '[{"id":"a","text":"The Dangers of Cycling"},{"id":"b","text":"How the Bicycle Changed over Time"},{"id":"c","text":"A German Inventor''s Life"},{"id":"d","text":"Why Women Prefer Bicycles"}]'::jsonb, 'b', 'The passage follows the bicycle''s designs from 1817 to the safety bicycle, so the title should cover its development.', 'easy', array['reading-comprehension','main-idea','step-mock-2']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm2-reading-13', 'reading', null, 'passage-sm2-4', null, null, 'In the passage, the word ''visible'' is closest in meaning to', '[{"id":"a","text":"hard to explain"},{"id":"b","text":"slow to arrive"},{"id":"c","text":"costly to repair"},{"id":"d","text":"easy to see"}]'::jsonb, 'd', 'Helping others gives results people can see at once, so ''visible'' means easy to see.', 'easy', array['reading-comprehension','vocabulary','step-mock-2']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm2-reading-14', 'reading', null, 'passage-sm2-4', null, null, 'All of the following are given as benefits of volunteering EXCEPT', '[{"id":"a","text":"earning a salary"},{"id":"b","text":"learning teamwork"},{"id":"c","text":"gaining confidence"},{"id":"d","text":"impressing universities and employers"}]'::jsonb, 'a', 'Skills, confidence and a better application are mentioned; nothing is said about being paid.', 'medium', array['reading-comprehension','detail','step-mock-2']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
