Receptionist: I''ll send you a text message to confirm.', 'What is the new appointment time?', '[{"id":"a","text":"Wednesday at five"},{"id":"b","text":"Monday at ten"},{"id":"c","text":"Wednesday at half past four"},{"id":"d","text":"Wednesday at four"}]'::jsonb, 'a', 'The receptionist first offers half past four, but the caller asks for five and she confirms it.', 'medium', array['listening-comprehension','step-mock-2']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm2-listening-9', 'listening', null, null, '/audio/listening/sm2-listening-9.mp3', 'Sara: Have you finished your part of the presentation, Noura?
Noura: Almost. I''ve done the slides about the history, but I still need the pictures.
Sara: I can find those. I''m good at searching online. What about the graphs?
Noura: Hanan said she would make them, but she has been ill all week.
Sara: Oh no. Then I''ll do the graphs too, and you can practise the speech. We present on Tuesday, so we have four days.
Noura: That would be a huge help. Thanks, Sara.', 'What has Noura already finished?', '[{"id":"a","text":"The graphs about the results"},{"id":"b","text":"The pictures for the last slides"},{"id":"c","text":"The slides about the history"},{"id":"d","text":"The speech for the presentation"}]'::jsonb, 'c', 'Noura says she has done the slides about the history but still needs the pictures.', 'easy', array['listening-comprehension','step-mock-2']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
