Faisal: And don''t forget water!
Ali: Of course.', 'Why does Faisal suggest leaving early?', '[{"id":"a","text":"To avoid the heat"},{"id":"b","text":"Because the tent must be returned"},{"id":"c","text":"So Ali can be back for training"},{"id":"d","text":"Because the stove is needed at noon"}]'::jsonb, 'c', 'Training starts at four, so they should be back by three.', 'medium', array['listening-comprehension','listening-inference','step-mock-2']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm2-listening-20', 'listening', null, null, '/audio/listening/sm2-listening-18.mp3', 'Ali: So, are we all going to the desert camp on Friday?
Faisal: Yes, but I checked the forecast, and it will be very windy, so I think Saturday is better.
Ali: Saturday? I can''t, I have football training in the afternoon.
Faisal: Training starts at four, right? We can leave in the morning and be back by three.
Ali: Hmm, that''s tight, but all right. Who''s bringing the tent?
Faisal: My uncle has a big one, and he said we can borrow it. You bring the food, and Majed will bring the stove.
Ali: Okay. I''ll buy sandwiches and fruit.
Faisal: And don''t forget water!
Ali: Of course.', 'Who will bring the stove?', '[{"id":"a","text":"Ali"},{"id":"b","text":"Faisal"},{"id":"c","text":"Faisal''s uncle"},{"id":"d","text":"Majed"}]'::jsonb, 'd', 'Faisal says Majed will bring the stove.', 'hard', array['listening-comprehension','step-mock-2']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm2-writing-1', 'writingAnalysis', null, null, null, null, 'Which sentence is punctuated correctly?', '[{"id":"a","text":"When the bell rang, the students left the class."},{"id":"b","text":"When the bell rang the students, left the class."},{"id":"c","text":"When the bell rang the students left, the class."},{"id":"d","text":"When, the bell rang the students left the class."}]'::jsonb, 'a', 'A comma follows an introductory clause: ''When the bell rang,''.', 'easy', array['punctuation','commas','step-mock-2']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
