Professor: Very rarely. Most bats are harmless and even helpful, because they control insects and some species pollinate flowers.', 'What does the time the echo takes tell the bat?', '[{"id":"a","text":"What colour an object is"},{"id":"b","text":"How fast the bat is flying"},{"id":"c","text":"How far away an object is"},{"id":"d","text":"Whether the object is alive"}]'::jsonb, 'c', 'The brain measures how long the echo took and so knows the distance.', 'medium', array['listening-comprehension','step-mock-3']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
