Caller: Thursday works. I''ll bring my father with me.', 'When will the caller see the flat?', '[{"id":"a","text":"On Saturday morning"},{"id":"b","text":"On Thursday morning"},{"id":"c","text":"On Thursday after two"},{"id":"d","text":"This evening"}]'::jsonb, 'c', 'The owner is free on Thursday after two o''clock, and the caller chooses Thursday.', 'medium', array['listening-comprehension','step-mock-5']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
insert into public.questions (id, section, course_id, passage_id, audio_url, transcript, prompt, options, correct_option_id, explanation, difficulty, tags) values ('sm5-listening-4', 'listening', null, null, '/audio/listening/sm5-listening-4.mp3', 'Lecturer: Sleep is divided into stages that repeat during the night. In light sleep, the body relaxes and the heartbeat slows. Deep sleep follows, and this is when the body repairs muscles and strengthens the immune system. The most famous stage is REM sleep, when most dreams occur and the brain is almost as active as when awake. A full cycle takes about ninety minutes, so adults go through four or five cycles in a night.
Student: Is it true that teenagers need more sleep?
Lecturer: Yes. They need between eight and ten hours, but many get far less, which affects memory and mood.', 'What is the lecture mainly about?', '[{"id":"a","text":"How to cure dreams"},{"id":"b","text":"Why people snore"},{"id":"c","text":"How the heart works"},{"id":"d","text":"The stages of sleep"}]'::jsonb, 'd', 'The lecturer describes the stages of sleep and the sleep cycle.', 'easy', array['listening-comprehension','step-mock-5']::text[]) on conflict (id) do update set section = excluded.section, course_id = excluded.course_id, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, transcript = excluded.transcript, prompt = excluded.prompt, options = excluded.options, correct_option_id = excluded.correct_option_id, explanation = excluded.explanation, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, tags = excluded.tags;
